---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Architecture — Cortex">
  <h1>Architecture</h1>

  <h2>How Cortex Works</h2>
  <p>
    Cortex is a VS Code extension that connects to <a href="https://github.com/opencode-ai/opencode" target="_blank">OpenCode</a>,
    an AI coding agent running as a local server. The extension provides a chat sidebar,
    inline code suggestions, and tool-based workflows.
  </p>

  <div class="diagram">
    <pre>
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│  VS Code UI  │ ←→  │ Cortex Ext.  │ ←→  │  OpenCode    │
│  (Sidebar +  │     │ (TypeScript) │     │  (Server)    │
│   Inline)    │     │              │     │              │
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────┬───────┘
                                                  │
                                          ┌───────▼───────┐
                                          │  AI Provider  │
                                          │  (OpenAI,     │
                                          │  Anthropic…)  │
                                          └───────────────┘</pre>
  </div>

  <h2>Components</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>SidebarProvider</strong> — manages the chat panel lifecycle, message routing, and plan/build modes</li>
    <li><strong>OpenCode Client</strong> — HTTP client to communicate with the OpenCode server</li>
    <li><strong>Context Service</strong> — gathers relevant code context via lexical + semantic search</li>
    <li><strong>Inline Completion</strong> — provides ghost-text suggestions in the editor</li>
    <li><strong>Plan Store</strong> — manages saved plans with checklists for the Plan→Build workflow</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Plan → Build Workflow</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Plan mode</strong>: Cortex analyzes your request and creates a structured plan with checklist</li>
    <li><strong>Approval</strong>: You review and approve the plan</li>
    <li><strong>Build mode</strong>: Cortex implements changes step by step, updating the checklist</li>
  </ol>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-top: 3rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  ol, ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .diagram {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .diagram pre {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
